<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1102] IgniteSpringBean should have getConfiguration() method</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1102</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is required for proper integration with Spring. See forum thread: &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/IgniteSpringBean-getter-method-for-IgniteConfiguration-td613.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/IgniteSpringBean-getter-method-for-IgniteConfiguration-td613.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I would also replace assertions with IllegalStateException throwing (same conditions and messages) since assertions looks weird on top level API class.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
